          "jcr:created": "Wed Sep 04 2019 17:42:52 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Giving and volunteering programs </span></span><br>\n<br>\nStryker’s employees fuel our companywide passion for improving the lives of others. Whether it’s by volunteering locally or donating globally, our people are driven to give. To improve quality of life for people around the world, we advance healthcare, support education, improve environmental health and enrich community culture—while keeping equity top of mind. We also care about the unique causes that motivate our employees, and we have made it easy to give back.<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Stryker’s global support <br>\n </span></span><br>\nWe support nonprofits that align with our social impact strategy. Our teams give back by volunteering their time, sharing their talents and raising funds for our signature partners and other nonprofits.</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Mar 06 2025 21:40:18 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
